  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ayapel garbage-free. Recycling &amp; swamp protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmental and visual pollution, caused by poor disposal of solid waste, is a problem in Ayapel, where Colombia&apos;s second most important wetland is located. Unfortunately, the absence of a recycling and waste disposal culture resulted in most waste ending up on the streets or finding its way into the sensitive wetland. CorpoAyapel implements an innovative social, economic and environmental model for recycling solid waste and preventing further degradation of the ecosystem.</narrative>
  </description>
